BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:alonnisos-palia-alonnisos-dekapentavgoustos-panigiri-and-alonnisian-we-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dekapentavgoustos panigiri and Alonnisian wedding\, Palia Alonnisos (Chora)
LOCATION:Palia Alonnisos\, Alonnisos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 15 August the Cultural Association stages a re-enactment of a traditional Alonnisian wedding in the old hilltop village\, in costume with the old songs\, at about 7 pm\, and from 8.30 the municipality's panigiri takes over with violin\, bouzouki and singers until dawn (in 2026 the glenti moved down to the harbour at 9.30 pm). The lanes of the Chora are car-free and the road up is a bottleneck\, so use the bus from Patitiri and walk back down the kalderimi if you are still standing.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/alonnisos/#palia-alonnisos-dekapentavgoustos-panigiri-and-alonnisian-we
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/alonnisos/#palia-alonnisos-dekapentavgoustos-panigiri-and-alonnisian-we
END:VEVENT
